<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no">
<title>ZS-026 猪肝鸡蛋粥 · 沧林食品</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#f0e9e2;color:#2c2c2c;padding:24px 16px;line-height:1.7}
.card{max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf8f5;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}

.meta{padding:20px 22px 14px;background:#fdf8f0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.meta .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B;background:#fef2ee;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px}
.meta h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:2px}
.meta .sub{font-size:12px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-bottom:10px}
.meta .sub em{font-style:normal;color:#C0392B;font-weight:600}
.meta .tags{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.meta .tags span{font-size:10px;padding:2px 10px;background:#f5ede5;border-radius:12px;color:#5a4f44}

.level-banner{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:10px 22px;background:#fef9f2;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8;flex-wrap:wrap}
.level-item{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0e9e2;color:#5a4f44}
.level-item.high{background:#C0392B;color:#fff}
.level-item.med{background:#E8D5B0;color:#5a4f44}
.level-item.green{background:#f0f6ec;color:#5a8f3c}

.section{padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.s-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-bottom:10px;padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:2px solid #f0ece6}
.story{font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#5a4f44}
.story em{color:#C0392B;font-style:normal;font-weight:600}

.index-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}
.index-item{background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center}
.index-item .label{font-size:9px;color:#b5aaa0}
.index-item .num{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B}
.index-item .desc{font-size:9px;color:#7a7269;margin-top:2px}

.cost-box{padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;padding:4px 0;color:#3a322a}
.row .v{font-weight:600}
.row.tot{border-top:1px solid #ddd4ca;margin-top:4px;padding-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B}
.roi{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}
.roi-b{flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-size:11px}
.roi-b .d{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:2px 0}
.roi-b.c{background:#fdf2ee;color:#E8652D}
.roi-b.n{background:#fef6ec;color:#D4A574}
.roi-b.i{background:#f0f6ec;color:#5a8f3c}

.steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
.step{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:12.5px;color:#5a4f44;padding:6px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px}
.step .num{width:20px;height:20px;background:#f5ede5;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}
.step em{color:#C0392B;font-style:normal;font-weight:600}

.ingr{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.ingr span{padding:4px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44}
.ingr span.key{background:#fef6f2;color:#E8652D;font-weight:600}

.risk-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:5px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44}
.risk-stars{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10px}
.risk-stars .on{color:#D4A574}
.risk-stars .off{color:#ddd}

.launch{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}
.launch span{padding:5px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44}

.scene-grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.scene-item{padding:5px 12px;background:#f0f6ec;color:#4a7a3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}

.rec-box{padding:12px 14px;background:#fef9f2;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #f0e6d8;margin-top:6px}
.rec-box .rec-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#E8652D;margin-bottom:4px}
.rec-box ul{list-style:none;padding-left:0}
.rec-box ul li{font-size:11.5px;color:#5a4f44;padding:3px 0 3px 16px;position:relative;line-height:1.6}
.rec-box ul li::before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:0;color:#5a8f3c;font-weight:700}

.copy-box{padding:10px 14px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8;margin-top:6px}
.copy-box em{color:#C0392B;font-style:normal}

.tip-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:5px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44}
.tip-item strong{color:#C0392B}

.pay{padding:20px 22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fdf8f0,#f5ede5)}
.pay .lock-icon{font-size:28px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:4px}
.pay h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;color:#3a322a;margin-bottom:8px}
.pay ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin-bottom:10px}
.pay ul li{font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;padding:4px 0 4px 16px;position:relative;line-height:1.6}
.pay ul li::before{content:"\2713";position:absolute;left:0;color:#5a8f3c;font-weight:700}
.pay .price-tag{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B;text-align:center;margin:10px 0 8px}
.pay .price-tag small{font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:#b5aaa0}
.pay .btn{display:block;text-align:center;padding:11px;background:#C0392B;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:12px}
.pay .note{font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;text-align:center;margin-top:6px}

.ftr{text-align:center;padding:16px 22px;font-size:10px;color:#bbb}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">

<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">ZS-026 · ¥7-9</div>
  <h1>ZS-026 猪肝鸡蛋粥</h1>
  <div class="sub">猪肝嫩滑 · 蛋花丝滑 · 补铁暖胃 · <em>成本¥2.5</em></div>
  <div class="tags">
    <span>#低投资</span>
    <span>#一人可做</span>
    <span>#粥</span>
    <span>#猪肝</span>
    <span>#早餐</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">推荐 ★★★★☆</span>
  <span class="level-item med">投入低</span>
  <span class="level-item green">一人可做</span>
  <span class="level-item med">早上爆款</span>
  <span class="level-item med">补铁卖点</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">发现这款产品</div>
  <div class="story">
    猪肝鸡蛋粥，广东人早上的元气一碗。凌晨四点，早餐摊的铁锅就咕嘟上了，粳米慢熬到米粒开花、粥水浓稠。猪肝切细丝，入滚粥一烫，颜色由深红转浅褐，最后关火打入一颗鸡蛋，蛋液在热粥里翻出丝滑蛋花。<br><br>
    这碗粥成本极低——猪肝50g才几毛钱、一个鸡蛋一元、粳米几十克——算下来<em>只要¥2.5</em>，卖<em>¥7-9一碗</em>，毛利率超70%。猪肝富含铁和维生素A，打出的"补铁明目"牌尤其打动宝妈和上班族。<br><br>
    关键是一个小摊一口锅就能出餐，不需要大型设备，很适合早餐档口和夜宵摊。搭配根油条就是一顿完整早餐，客单价轻松拉到10-12块。
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目指数</div>
  <div class="index-grid">
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">摆摊指数</div><div class="num">8/10</div><div class="desc">轻便出摊</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">复购指数</div><div class="num">7/10</div><div class="desc">适合常吃</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">难度</div><div class="num">★☆☆☆☆</div><div class="desc">猪肝切细就行</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">利润</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">超70%毛利率</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>卖价</span><span class="v">7-9元/碗</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>成本</span><span class="v">2.5元/碗</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>单碗利润</span><span class="v" style="color:#C0392B">4.5-6.5元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销50碗日利润</span><span class="v">225-325元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销80碗日利润</span><span class="v">360-520元</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>启动投入</span><span class="v">≈¥300-600</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-top:6px">回本周期</div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div>保守</div><div class="d">2天</div><div>日销50碗</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div>正常</div><div class="d">1天</div><div>日销80碗</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div>理想</div><div class="d">1天</div><div>日销120碗</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">核心原料</div>
  <div class="ingr">
    <span class="key">猪肝 50g</span>
    <span class="key">鸡蛋 1个</span>
    <span class="key">粳米 50g</span>
    <span>盐</span>
    <span>姜丝</span>
    <span>味精</span>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:11px;color:#7a7269;margin-top:6px">辅料：盐少许 · 姜丝提味 · 味精增鲜</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">工艺骨架（免费看）</div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step"><span class="num">1</span>猪肝切细丝或薄片，粳米淘洗备用</div>
    <div class="step"><span class="num">2</span>粳米加水煮至粥底浓稠、米粒开花</div>
    <div class="step"><span class="num">3</span>下猪肝丝入滚粥，烫至<em>颜色转浅即熟</em></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="num">4</span>打入鸡蛋，<em>立即关火</em>，搅出蛋花</div>
    <div class="step"><span class="num">5</span>加盐、姜丝、味精调味，再稍煮片刻即可</div>
  </div>
  <div class="rec-box" style="margin-top:8px">
    <div class="rec-title">💡 关键诀窍</div>
    <ul>
      <li>猪肝切得越细嫩滑感越好，粗了口感老</li>
      <li>打入鸡蛋后立即关火，余温足够让蛋液凝成蛋花</li>
      <li>粥底要熬够时间，米粒不开花粥就不稠，口感差一大截</li>
      <li>姜丝去腥，不能省</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">启动清单</div>
  <div class="launch">
    <span>不锈钢锅 60元</span>
    <span>卡式炉+气罐 150元</span>
    <span>不锈钢碗 30元</span>
    <span>保温桶 80元</span>
    <span>切菜板 15元</span>
    <span>刀具 10元</span>
    <span>折叠桌 40元</span>
    <span>打包碗+盖子 0.4元/套</span>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44">
    <span><strong>总投入：</strong>约300-600元</span>
    <span><strong>占地：</strong>1m摊位</span>
    <span><strong>人员：</strong>1人</span>
    <span><strong>上手：</strong>1天</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">适合场景</div>
  <div class="scene-grid">
    <span class="scene-item">早餐摊</span>
    <span class="scene-item">夜市</span>
    <span class="scene-item">小区门口</span>
    <span class="scene-item">地铁口</span>
    <span class="scene-item">学校周边</span>
    <span class="scene-item">工业区</span>
    <span class="scene-item">医院门口</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>猪肝有腥味处理不当</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆☆☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">姜丝去腥足够</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>猪肝不易久存</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">☆☆☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">当天买当天用</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>季节性</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">☆</span><span class="off">☆☆☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">四季皆可</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>竞争同质化</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">☆☆☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">可搭配油条差异化</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">推荐搭配</div>
  <div class="story" style="font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;margin-bottom:6px">单品售价7-9元/碗</div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <div style="flex:1;min-width:130px;padding:8px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;text-align:center">
      <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3a322a">+ 油条</div>
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">经典早餐CP</div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex:1;min-width:130px;padding:8px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;text-align:center">
      <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3a322a">+ 煎饼</div>
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">套餐¥12-15</div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex:1;min-width:130px;padding:8px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;text-align:center">
      <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3a322a">+ 豆浆</div>
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">暖身组合</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8">
    ✔ 补铁明目是差异卖点，打在招牌上吸引宝妈和上班族<br>
    ✔ 一碗粥+油条，客单价轻松拉到10-12元
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">对标项目 & 竞争优势</div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px">
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;padding:5px 8px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:6px"><span>对标：皮蛋瘦肉粥（8-12元）</span><span style="font-size:9px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0;background:#f0f6ec;color:#5a8f3c">猪肝成本更低</span></div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;padding:5px 8px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:6px"><span>对标：白粥（3-5元）</span><span style="font-size:9px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0;background:#f0f6ec;color:#5a8f3c">有料粥溢价更高</span></div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;padding:5px 8px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:6px"><span>对标：猪肉粥（8-10元）</span><span style="font-size:9px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0;background:#f0f6ec;color:#5a8f3c">猪肝价差大·营养卖点</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8">
    ✔ 猪肝成本远低于猪肉/牛肉，同样的售价利润更高<br>
    ✔ "补铁明目"养生标签比普通粥更有话术抓手<br>
    ✔ 成本只要2.5元/碗，毛利超70%，量大更有优势
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">销售话术</div>
  <div class="copy-box">
    "猪肝鸡蛋粥~补铁明目~来一碗不？"<br>
    "新鲜的猪肝现切现煮，早上来一碗暖身子"<br>
    "妹子，猪肝补铁，适合你们~加点姜丝去腥，味道好得很"<br>
    喊一嗓子：<em>"猪肝鸡蛋粥~七块钱~营养又暖和~"</em>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">避坑指南</div>
  <div class="tip-item"><span><strong>猪肝不新鲜</strong>——猪肝必须当天采买，隔夜的腥味盖不住，顾客一吃就知道不对</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item"><span><strong>猪肝切太厚</strong>——厚了煮不熟或者煮老了，口感发硬发柴，切细丝口感最好</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item"><span><strong>鸡蛋下早了</strong>——鸡蛋必须在关火后打入，余温凝固蛋花才丝滑，煮久了成蛋渣</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item"><span><strong>粥底太稀</strong>——粳米一定要熬到米粒开花、粥水浓稠，看着就值这个价</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item"><span><strong>姜丝放太少</strong>——猪肝腥味重，姜丝是去腥关键，宁多勿少</span></div>
</div>

<div class="pay">
  <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
  <h3>¥19.9 解锁完整版</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>完整配方：猪肝切法克数+鸡蛋入锅时机+粥水配比</li>
    <li>完整工艺：选肝·切肝·煮粥·下肝·打蛋·调味全流程参数</li>
    <li>成本拆分：猪肝/鸡蛋/粳米/姜/调料逐项算清</li>
    <li>供应链建议：猪肝批发渠道+粳米品牌推荐</li>
    <li>3种变体：猪肝瘦肉粥/猪肝肠粉/猪肝汤粉配方</li>
    <li>出摊流程时间表+保温打包方案</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="price-tag">¥19.9 <small>永久解锁</small></div>
  <a class="btn" href="javascript:void(0)">加微信 · 19.9元解锁配方</a>
